If you want to get the multi-channel engagement score by country and brand in Q1 2025, you would need a SELECT query that joins the necessary tables and filters the data based on the specified criteria.

Here's an example of what the SELECT query might look like:

```sql
SELECT DG.country_code, DB.brand_name, SUM(IA.total_multichannel_score) as total_multichannel_score
